# key-ring: the saved game the key-ring enhanced session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a key for lock 1 (0x102, owner 1), the lock of the
# locked door at (36, 8) on level 1, and a key for another lock (0x103, owner 2), into the pack,
# and the player moved to (36, 7), the corridor south of that door. Saved in slot I, described
# "keys"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x102 owner 1
44100 cheat give 0x103 owner 2
44200 cheat goto 1 36 7
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "keys"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key k
50700 key e
50900 key y
51100 key s
52000 key enter
